Addresses review feedback from PR #3 regarding memory leak prevention and state management issues.

## Changes

- **Carousel components**: Removed `emblaApi` from cleanup effect dependency arrays and implemented ref pattern to prevent premature destruction while ensuring proper cleanup on unmount

```tsx
const emblaApiRef = useRef<typeof emblaApi>(undefined);

useEffect(() => {
  emblaApiRef.current = emblaApi;
}, [emblaApi]);

useEffect(() => {
  return () => {
    if (emblaApiRef.current) {
      emblaApiRef.current.destroy();
    }
  };
}, []);
```

- **PageTransition**: Consolidated sessionStorage flag removal to single location in initial state, preventing race conditions in React Strict Mode and fast navigation scenarios. Pathname effect now only sets animation state when flag exists, avoiding unintended state overrides.

